@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
participant "NavigationDemo\nClient" as Client
participant "Navigator\nContext" as Navigator
participant "CarRouteStrategy" as Car
participant "WalkingRouteStrategy" as Walk

User -> Client: run application
Client -> Car: create
Client -> Navigator: new Navigator(Car)
Client -> Navigator: buildRoute(request)
Navigator -> Car: plan(request)
Car --> Navigator: car RoutePlan
Navigator --> Client: car RoutePlan

Client -> Walk: create
Client -> Navigator: setRouteStrategy(Walk)
Client -> Navigator: buildRoute(request)
Navigator -> Walk: plan(request)
Walk --> Navigator: walking RoutePlan
Navigator --> Client: walking RoutePlan
@enduml

